shing”. Section 1–201. “Buyer”. Section 2–103. “Conform”. Section 2–106. “Contract”. Section 1–201. “Goods”. Section 2–105. “Notifies”. Section 1–202. “Reasonable time”. Section 1–205. “Remedy”. Section 1–201. “Seasonably”. Section 1–205. § 2–607ARTICLE 2. SALES"